{"4186460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Hole Never Ends", "steam_appid": 4186460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A VR descent into darkness. Deep beneath the Karst Rift Zone, expeditions vanish without a trace. Whispers echo through the caverns, strange shapes move in the dark—and now it’s your turn to enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True immersion: Crawl, climb, and squeeze through suffocating tunnels with only your headlamp to guide you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/89aa877551b0fcd3433d47bbad630638.poster.avif?t=1784810140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/89aa877551b0fcd3433d47bbad630638.webm?t=1784810140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/89aa877551b0fcd3433d47bbad630638.mp4?t=1784810140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure vs. terror: Mine rare minerals and relics, trade with hidden merchants, and upgrade your gear—knowing every discovery draws the darkness closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/e1321f6bd53bc3e2d39ea3d933b652ef.poster.avif?t=1784810140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/e1321f6bd53bc3e2d39ea3d933b652ef.webm?t=1784810140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/e1321f6bd53bc3e2d39ea3d933b652ef.mp4?t=1784810140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/ab75eef9c0725f6a279d68a00a2554bd.poster.avif?t=1784810140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/ab75eef9c0725f6a279d68a00a2554bd.webm?t=1784810140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/ab75eef9c0725f6a279d68a00a2554bd.mp4?t=1784810140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable fear: Collapsing tunnels, shifting paths, and creatures that stalk your every move. Even the cave itself feels alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/6d57483227b3550433fbdde7527c19b4.poster.avif?t=1784810140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/6d57483227b3550433fbdde7527c19b4.webm?t=1784810140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/6d57483227b3550433fbdde7527c19b4.mp4?t=1784810140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endgame: Find the corruption source, face its guardian, and destroy it… if you make it that far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/493288f65316c38e14341b92ed32ece0.poster.avif?t=1784810140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/493288f65316c38e14341b92ed32ece0.webm?t=1784810140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/493288f65316c38e14341b92ed32ece0.mp4?t=1784810140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARNING Not a casual VR adventure. Expect screams, racing heartbeats, and fear that lingers after the headset comes off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the hole never ends. Escape with treasure—if you can.<br><br>Contains content made by SCP Foundation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 International License. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This software includes third party libraries and solutions that are not licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 International License. Please check the license.txt file (in the root directory of game files) for more information.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A VR descent into darkness. Deep beneath the Karst Rift Zone, expeditions vanish without a trace. Whispers echo through the caverns, strange shapes move in the dark—and now it’s your turn to enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True immersion: Crawl, climb, and squeeze through suffocating tunnels with only your headlamp to guide you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/89aa877551b0fcd3433d47bbad630638.poster.avif?t=1784810140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/89aa877551b0fcd3433d47bbad630638.webm?t=1784810140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati