if?t=1784810140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/6d57483227b3550433fbdde7527c19b4.webm?t=1784810140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/6d57483227b3550433fbdde7527c19b4.mp4?t=1784810140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endgame: Find the corruption source, face its guardian, and destroy it… if you make it that far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/493288f65316c38e14341b92ed32ece0.poster.avif?t=1784810140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/493288f65316c38e14341b92ed32ece0.webm?t=1784810140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4186460/extras/493288f65316c38e14341b92ed32ece0.mp4?t=1784810140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARNING Not a casual VR adventure. Expect screams, racing heartbeats, and fear that lingers after the headset comes off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the hole never ends. Escape with treasure—if you can.<br><br>Contains content made by SCP Foundation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 International License. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This software includes third party libraries and solutions that are not licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 International License. Please check the license.txt file (in the root directory of game files) for more information.</p>", "short_description": "An intense VR adventure where you crawl through twisting caves, face unseen terrors, evade crea